# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized deployment:** Run FusionDirectory through Docker Compose with the project's standard role-meta wiring."
msgstr "**Контейнердик жайгаштыруу:** Run Run FusionDirectory аркылуу аркылуу Docker Compose Бул долбоордун стандарттуу ролдук мета зымдары менен."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized deployment:** Run FusionDirectory through Docker Compose with the project’s standard role-meta wiring."
