# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Use a Password Manager** You SHOULD use a reliable password manager such as [KeePassXC](https://keepassxc.org/) 🔐. (Learn more about [password managers](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_manager) on Wikipedia.) KeePassXC is available for both smartphones and PCs, and it can automatically generate strong, random passwords."
