# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, baked into the image alongside the other plugins in ``files/plugins.txt``. The surface is declared as the ``mcp`` service in ``meta/services.yml``."
